    "Id": "vehicledef_THUMPER",
    "Name": "Thumper TAV-0",
    "Details": "The original version of the vehicle produced at the end of the Star League until after the Succession Wars utilized an Internal Combustion Engine power plant. The Thumper was created by Brooks Incorporated as a cheap knock off of the SLDF's Thor Artillery Vehicle. The vehicle was mass produced and sold to the Successor States from 2735 to 3046. The Thumper mounts it's namesake; the Thumper Artillery piece.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       320     30\n<b>Left</b>         210     30\n<b>Right</b>       210     30\n<b>Rear</b>        140     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      880    120</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color>",
    "Icon": "Thumper"
  },
